### Get All Posts
GET http://localhost:3000/posts

### Get Posts by Sender
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?sender=<USER_ID>


### Get All Comments For Specific Post
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/<POST_ID>/comments

### Update Post
PUT http://localhost:3000/posts/<POST_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "createdBy": "<USER_ID>",
  "title": "Hello updated",
  "content": "Updated content"
}

### Create Comment
POST http://localhost:3000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "<POST_ID>",
  "createdBy": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "message": "Nice post!"
}

### Get All Comments
GET http://localhost:3000/comments

### Get Comment By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>

### Update Comment
PUT http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "postId": "<POST_ID>",
  "createdBy": "507f1f77bcf86cd799439011",
  "message": "Updated comment text"
}

### Delete Comment
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/<COMMENT_ID>

